<Base title="About HumAIn Logic" description="HumAIn Logic helps everyday people and small businesses use AI calmly: plain-language tool search, AI news, a Job safety tracker and one weekly email." jsonld={ld}>
<section class="page-head"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">About</span><h1>About HumAIn Logic</h1></div></section>
<div class="container section" style="padding-top:var(--space-6)"><div class="prose">
<p class="lede">HumAIn Logic (say it “human logic”) helps everyday people and small businesses use AI without stress. AI, explained calmly. Find the right tool for the job.</p>
<p>The site has four parts:</p>
<ul>
<li>A <a href="/tools">tool directory</a>. Describe a task in your own words and we match it to tools that can help.</li>
<li>A calm <a href="/news">AI news</a> feed, collected from public sources and always linked to the original.</li>
<li>A <a href="/tracker">Job safety tracker</a> that shows how AI is likely to change common jobs and what you can do about it.</li>
<li><a href="/newsletter">The Sunday Brief</a>, one calm email a week.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Why we exist</h2>
<p>We exist to spread awareness of AI as the technology around us keeps changing, and changing fast. Our aim is simple: to help you understand what is happening, calmly and clearly, so you can meet it with confidence rather than worry.</p>
<h2 id="promise">Our promise</h2>
<ul><li>No company pays to be listed or ranked higher. There are no sponsored listings.</li><li>Some links may be affiliate links. They never change which tools we list or how we rank them.</li><li>We always show where facts come from, and when they were checked. If a price isn't confirmed, we say so.</li><li>We label anything written with AI.</li><li>No pop-ups, no fear-bait, no hype. No account needed, and nothing is behind an email wall.</li></ul>
<h2 id="money">How we make money</h2>
<p>Some links on the site may be affiliate links, for example through our partner network Impact (used by Coursera). If you sign up or buy through one, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. There are no ads and no sponsored listings, and the rules above still apply: payment never changes what we list or how we rank it.</p>
<h2>Who runs it</h2>
<p>HumAIn Logic is an independent project, tended slowly and with care. It grew from a simple wish: that the world of AI could feel a little more human, and a lot less daunting. Every page is written in that spirit, unhurried, honest and made for real people.</p>
<h2 id="founder">Founder and editor</h2>
<p><strong>Jordan Lewis M.S.</strong> founded HumAIn Logic and edits the site, including its guides. Jordan started it to make AI feel a little more human and a lot less daunting, and every guide is written to that standard: plain language, sources shown, and dates checked.</p>
<h2>Get in touch</h2>
<p>Spotted a mistake or a price that changed? Email <a href="mailto:hello@humainlogic.com?subject=Question%20about%20HumAIn%20Logic">hello@humainlogic.com</a> or see <a href="/contact">Contact</a>. To learn how outlooks are set, read <a href="/methodology">How we decide</a>.</p>
</div></div>
